{"product_id":"eleaf-aster-rt-starter-kit","title":"Eleaf Aster RT with Melo RT 22 Tank Starter Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Eleaf RT Starter Kit features the Aster RT Mod and the Melo RT 22 Sub-Ohm Tank. The Eleaf Aster RT Mod features a \"RT\" recessed tank design which allows the Aster RT Mod to hold and hide 22mm diameter or smaller tanks inside. This unique design allows for the ultimate stealth vaping experience. The Aster RT features a high capacity built-in 4400mAh battery and can fire up to 100 watts. The Aster RT supports Nickel 200, Titanium, Stainless Steel 316 and TCR in temperature control mode. Bypass and smart modes are available as well. The Aster RT features preheat, stealth and custom logo functionality. The micro USB port allows for both firmware updates and charging.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThe Melo RT 22 features many improvements on the previous Eleaf Melo tanks. The Melo RT 22 features a 3.8ml e-Liquid capacity in a leak resistant cup design glass tank. A \"RT\" or retractable top fill design allows for easy refills. A knurled airflow control valve may be used to precisely adjust the airflow output. The Melo RT 22 utilizes Eleaf ER SS316L atomizer heads for variable wattage or SS316L temperature control mode. The recommended wattage for Eleaf ER SS316L 0.3ohm atomizer heads are within the range of 40 to 100 watts.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlease Note:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Eleaf Aster RT battries are included in price.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlease Note:\u003c\/strong\u003e Due to the design of the device, the Eleaf Aster RT is only compatible with 22mm tanks or smaller. 23mm and larger tanks are NOT compatible and will not fit this device. Certain 22mm tanks may not fit if a part of the tank juts out such as the airflow valve or top cap. If you are unsure if your tank fits, feel free to contact us and we will confirm if your tank is compatible or not.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eWe recommend a 2\" or longer tank for a comfortable vaping experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeatures and Specs for Aster RT Mod:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 3-1\/16\" x 2\" x 1-1\/2\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\"RT\" Recessed Tank Design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOnly Compatible with 22mm in Diameter and Smaller Tanks\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpring Loaded 510 Contact Pin\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBuilt-In 4400mAh Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVariable Wattage: 1 - 100W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTemperature Control: Nickel 200 (Ni200), Titanium (Ti), Stainless Steel 316 (SS316), TCR Mode\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTemperature Control: 100-315C \/ 200-600F\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBypass and Smart Mode Available\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Range: 0.1 – 3.5 ohm in Variable Wattage\/Bypass Mode\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance: 0.05 - 1.5 ohm in Temperature Control mode\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMaximum Output Current: 25A\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePreheat Function\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCustom Logo\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStealth Function\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMicro USB Port for Firmware Updates or Charging\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMaximum Charging Current: 1A\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDual Circuit Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeatures and Specs for Melo RT 22 Tank:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 2-7\/16\" x 7\/8\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e22mm Diameter\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3.8ml e-Liquid Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e510 Threaded\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\"RT\" or Retractable Top Fill Design for Easy Refills\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eKnurled Airflow Control Valve Design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGlass Tank\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLeak Resistant Cup Design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e510 Drip Tip Compatible\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIncludes (2) Eleaf ER SS316L 0.3ohm Atomizer Head for Variable Wattage or SS316L TC Mode\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRecommended Wattage: 40-100 Watts\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Eleaf","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41700846436407,"sku":"69d26296947f5","price":6585.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/eleaf-aster-rt-kenya.jpg?v=1749517732","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/eleaf-aster-rt-starter-kit","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




